{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22138","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 九 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"原生衣百结，颜子食一箪。\n欢然乐其志，有以忘饥寒。\n今我何人哉，德不及先贤。\n衣食幸相属，胡爲不自安。\n况兹清渭曲，居处安且闲。\n榆柳百余树，茅茨十数间。\n寒负檐下日，热濯涧底泉。\n日出犹未起，日入已复眠。\n西风满村巷，清凉八月天。\n但有鸡犬声，不闻车马喧。\n时倾一尊酒，坐望东南山。\n穉侄初学步，牵衣戏我前。\n即此自可乐，庶几颜与原。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}